## Summary

Adds a smarter AI, selectable difficulty, and a mobile-responsive layout. Implemented in dependency order (AI → difficulty → responsive). No game-logic/type changes for the responsive pass; all 41 tests pass, `tsc` + build clean.

**Smart AI (`ai.ts`).** `getAIMove` now takes two new optional params and uses hunt/target:

```ts
getAIMove(previousAttacks, playerShips: Set<number>[] = [], difficulty = 'normal')
// confirmedHits = attacked cells that belong to a player ship
// easy   -> always random from unattacked
// normal -> if any confirmedHits: random unattacked neighbor (no row-wrap on left/right);
//           else random
// hard   -> if a ship has >=2 hits: prefer the collinear cell(s) extending the run
//           (same row => step 1, same col => step 10); else neighbor targeting; else random
```

Params are optional with defaults so the existing single-arg call sites/tests keep working.

**Difficulty (`types.ts`, `game.ts`, `Game.tsx`).** Added `Difficulty = 'easy'|'normal'|'hard'` and `GameState.difficulty` (default `'normal'`, set via `initializeGame(difficulty='normal')`). `Game.tsx` holds difficulty in a separate React state, renders an Easy/Normal/Hard toggle (shown at game start and after a game ends; persists across New Game), and passes `difficulty` + `game.playerShips` into `getAIMove` each AI turn.

**Responsive (`Cell.tsx`, `Board.tsx`, `Game.tsx`).** `Cell` is `w-7 h-7 sm:w-9 sm:h-9 md:w-11 md:h-11`; the 3-column `[Your Fleet][Boards][Enemy Fleet]` row is `flex flex-col md:flex-row` (panels stack above/below boards on mobile); the two boards are `flex flex-col sm:flex-row`; headings/labels and the difficulty selector scale/wrap on small screens.

## Tests

Added to `getAIMove`: targets a neighbor after a hit, falls back to random when no neighbors remain, hard continues collinear (`[44,47]` for hits `{45,46}`), easy ignores hunt; plus `initializeGame` difficulty default/override. 35 → 41 tests, all passing.

Verified live: difficulty selector renders with the active option highlighted.

